  "decision_conditions": [
    "Class C3(b) only covers up to six people (adults) living together as a single household and receiving care. Insufficient information has been provided regarding the proposed change of use from Class C3a to C3b to assess this application. In addition, there is no comprehensive evidence or information regarding what type of care the residents would receive and to robustly demonstrate how the residents would live and interact together and form a single household.There are concerns regarding the intensification of use of the property. Based on the information submitted with the application, the proposed use would not fall under Class C3(b) and therefore would give rise to a material change of use for which planning permission is required."
